WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.659
This module is really about meaning Two columns can
both be stored

00:00:05.673 --> 00:00:11.391
as integers and still require completely different
analytical treatment A

00:00:11.405 --> 00:00:16.710
ZIP code uses digits but is a label A satisfaction
score may use one through

00:00:16.736 --> 00:00:23.328
five but represents ordered categories A visit count
is a true count Celsius

00:00:23.355 --> 00:00:29.670
temperature is a measurement with equal differences
but without a meaningful true zero That

00:00:29.697 --> 00:00:33.736
is why we do not let the software dtype make the
analytical decision for us
